0 Scratch: can a plate-with-holes be pinned down onto a motor's top face?
0 The Small Hub has no studs, so the motor tops are the only broad anchor
0 on this rover. Each motor offers four upward pin holes on a 40x40
0 rectangle. Question: does a 3709 (2x4 plate, 3 vertical holes) bridge a
0 pair of them, and is the grip deep enough, or does a 12-thick plate
0 always read SHALLOW?
